  "interpretation": [
    "All trained variants improve common-state expert-argmax agreement over the frozen SFT baseline.",
    "At seed 17, hard targets yield higher argmax agreement; soft targets yield lower hard NLL, expert-forward KL, both vector Brier scores and action-label ECE on all three evaluated splits.",
    "These are action-policy fit metrics on expert-visited states, not winning-probability calibration or closed-loop success rates.",
    "Dev CE uses different hard/soft targets across arms and is used only for within-arm checkpoint selection.",
    "Checkpoint hashes are validated against recorded run receipts; large weight files are not rehashed by this metadata-only audit."
  ],
